# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2539
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_56bf37ad:

    # r "{i}You{/i} can ride, can't you?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2543
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_df43aa31:

    # s "Of course."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2547
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_3afdbc2b:

    # p "Are you... joking?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2549
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_74a23347:

    # r "Yes. It's a safe road. And we'll look like local travels, not foreign merchants who might be worth the risk."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2551
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_4ae7b5cf:

    # "Rajeeyah had hinted that her lover was, indeed, one of those highwaymen—at least, living outside the law."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2553
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_1f0b3bbd:

    # "This is one of the rare times that you realize the cheetah, herself, might have more familiarity than she lets on."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2555
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_18d24d9f:

    # "But it's best not to dwell on that, surely."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2557
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_208e3a6b:

    # p "I'll take your word for it."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2559
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_5e793b0e:

    # r "Let's be off, then. Aguz is a good place to reach by evening, and I'd like to ensure we do it. That one is yours, [name]."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2563
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_855ca140:

    # "The dun-colored creature is lankier than the beasts of burden of your hometown, with an arched neck that gives him a proud, vaguely defiant air."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2567
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_482f31e8:

    # "Neither Samuel nor Rajeeyah are watching you, thankfully, but you decide to concentrate as if the whole ship was your audience."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2571
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_3cca1cdb:

    # "In this case, at least, your memory serves you well. Your horse gives a commentary snort, but offers no protest while you situate yourself in the saddle."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2575
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_de737936:

    # "Sam seems to have a little more difficulty. It takes [him] a few tries to get [his] foot in place, and after [he] settles the lanky canine sways uncomfortably."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2577
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_1ba38856:

    # p "You're ready, Sam?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2581
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_311ba406:

    # s "I am. Don't you worry about this one, [name]."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2587
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_7145f334:

    # "Rajeeyah is busy with her own horse, thankfully, and you take the opportunity to put what you remember into practice without an audience."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2591
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_3cca1cdb_1:

    # "In this case, at least, your memory serves you well. Your horse gives a commentary snort, but offers no protest while you situate yourself in the saddle."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2593
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_09b8f151:

    # r "Just follow me."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2597
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_3ad301c0:

    # "She must mean: follow her through the streets and out the gate that lead to the outskirts of Mogador."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2604
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_c561a969:

    # "Once you're past that, it soon becomes clear that there is only one road."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2606
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_98005b06:

    # "To your right, a bleak and barren desert. To your left... more of the same, although the ocean cannot be far beyond. Hints of wispy fog are already lifting, and mostly gone."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2608
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_c0ffe9f9:

    # "Ten minutes becomes twenty, or so—the sun climbing noticeably higher in the sky—and only the same bleak expanse."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2619
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_42ea3753:

    # "Rajeeyah looks over her shoulder at you. Committed to the journey, now, the cheetah's mood has lifted, too."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2621
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_5baa4f7d:

    # r "I had forgotten how beautiful it is."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2623
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_e3269ff2:

    # "She indicates the landscape with a sweep of her arm."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2625
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_c01e8bc2:

    # "Your first reaction is one of incredulity. Rather than voicing it, you try to see it as Rajeeyah might."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2627
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_399a957f:

    # "It's not as though you'd spent much time imagining deserts. In your mind, though, they were endless stretches of dust and sand, smoothed to soft billows by the wind."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2629
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_f5d5fc88:

    # "This, though? This is jagged and harsh. The sun strikes crisp shadows from the rocks and scrubby plants. Ahead of you, the track you're following winds around reefs and boulders."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2631
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_d2dc1938:

    # "Vast as the sea, it feels every bit as foreboding."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2635
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_23e96b3c:

    # "Rajeeyah's uncharacteristic laugh cleaves into your thoughts, sharp as the edge between shadow and sunlight."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2637
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_50ee9430:

    # r "You don't have to agree, [name]."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2641
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_9fcc9bb0:

    # p "I haven't seen anything like it, that's for sure."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2645
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_68f52607:

    # "What you do, instead, is make an effort to examine the scenery more closely. Sam is doing the same."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2647
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_292bfb0f:

    # "...And for the same reason."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2654
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_d71a0a72:

    # s "I wonder if every tree on this road has its own name. You wouldn't need so many."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2656
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_819ef01a:

    # p "It's difficult to imagine living here, with so little to subsist on."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2663
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_ca18795e:

    # r "No one does. Only on the rivers. It's not as stark as far inland, though."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2665
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_57008cab:

    # p "It's harsher there?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2667
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_d43ecd3a:

    # r "Yes. Hotter. Less water. Only camels and their kindred spirits can endure it."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2674
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_8f5bd4f7:

    # s "Camels!"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2681
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_cf8b4dbb:

    # r "You are not such a kindred spirit, [Samuel]. I see how you drink."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2688
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_722ed750:

    # s "What?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2695
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_38c5ae4d:

    # r "You pull at that water skin like someone who has never doubted their ability to fill it again."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2697
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_3ed0107e:

    # "Sam—who is gripping it in [his] right paw—looks at the half-full leather sack with concern."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2704
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_a442b8b8:

    # s "Can we?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2711
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_d36f201b:

    # r "Yes. Of course. On this road, it will not be a problem for us—or the horses."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2718
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_90b7dbe9:

    # s "Instead of camels..."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2725
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_9a599947:

    # r "Precisely."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2732
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_382777e9:

    # "Indeed, you stop at a well in the early afternoon. It's of stone—a familiar, European design that Rajeeyah attributes to the Portuguese."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2736
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_da47cfc8:

    # "The well is unattended, but clearly well-used; the mechanism turns smoothly, bringing up a bucket full of cool, clean water."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2738
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_21d1f625:

    # "Sam drinks it with relish, and looks at Rajeeyah pitifully when she starts back for her horse."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2742
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_c0c0ed57:

    # s "Already?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2744
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_59dc7398:

    # r "Yes. We've only gone a few leagues."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2748
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_6189831f:

    # s "Might've walked that, then. Didn't know it'd be like this."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2750
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_128d53ee:

    # "Rajeeyah stops, turning to look at [him]."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2754
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_e3b78559:

    # r "What do you mean, you didn't know? Which part?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2758
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_fa69b79e:

    # s "How bloody awkward it is, sittin' on somebody's back like that..."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2762
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_04de4e19:

    # r "You said you knew how to ride a horse."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2764
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_1c022296:

    # s "Well, that's so. But I didn't say I'd {i}done{/i} it, now."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2768
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_a798dfc4:

    # r "[Samuel]!"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2772
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_b670046c:

    # s "Well, I wasn't about to let you do this on your own. If it means I be learning to do something new? That's no trouble to me."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2774
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_aed3aaca:

    # r "It is if you hurt yourself."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2778
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_e8a665d7:

    # s "But I didn't. It's just... me legs ache. I got more of 'em than you do, you know. That's all."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2780
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_4f120619:

    # "Rajeeyah shakes her head in disbelief."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2782
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_1fca3ca8:

    # r "First, only proportionally, not in absolute terms."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2784
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_e1337b2f:

    # r "Second, I should send you back."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2788
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_e9d62c24:

    # s "But you won't. 'Cause we's friends, and you like me. And you know I wouldn't go."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2792
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_ae586ab3:

    # r "So I do. [name], can you help [him]?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2797
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_675644b4:

    # "Sam's protests notwithstanding, you give the maned wolf a push to settle [him] back atop [his] horse."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2799
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_c48053db:

    # "{i}Really, now{/i}, you hear Rajeeyah hiss, before she starts off at a brisk trot. But you suspect it was said with a smile at Sam's cheekiness."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2801
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_a62b1cab:

    # "...And [his] concern."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2805
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_d36e0887:

    # "What you do, instead, is make an effort to examine the scenery more closely."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2807
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_e9f4b95c:

    # "At first, this is still an attempt to empathize with the cheetah."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2809
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_7ee0e287:

    # "Soon enough, it's an attempt not to fall asleep in the saddle. You are the only ones traveling, and almost nothing changes about the landscape."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2811
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_1c426ef5:

    # "A brief stop at an unattended well is the only excitement you have. You savor the cool, clean water, and let the horses do the same."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2815
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_fe6cda98:

    # "On the move again, you gradually begin to appreciate that there is {i}some{/i} variety. The rocks are a thousand shades of tan and ochre; the sky, a thousand shades of cornflower."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2819
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_1a817802:

    # "Movement catches your eye, from off to the side of the path. A bird—a buzzard, you think, judging by the wingspan—takes awkward flight, crossing Rajeeyah's path."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2823
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_71c01b46:

    # "Her horse starts, as the shadow crosses over its face, shying off towards the opposite direction."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2825
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_6c567b66:

    # "And then, just as suddenly—before your own mount has a chance for the reaction to become contagious—the beast settles down."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2829
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_c154d484:

    # "It only then that you see Rajeeyah's frame relax, and realize her reflexes are what has quieted it."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2831
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_18763019:

    # p "Are you—"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2835
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_a249ea90:

    # r "I'm fine. Startled."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2839
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_a8520922:

    # p "So was I.{w} So was your horse."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2841
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_7d8796f1:

    # r "Yes. I suppose we must be the first travelers to come through here for a few hours. Nothing serious."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2843
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_56c840c2:

    # p "You handled it pretty well. Better than I would've."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2849
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_3802ffa1:

    # s "Or me, even."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2853
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_f8b6e7bc:

    # r "'Even'?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2855
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_0b0aabe9:

    # "Her adeptness, you reflect when you resume, is more than commonly remarkable."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2859
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_0df4d27f:

    # p "Where did you learn to ride a horse, anyway? I thought your family were silk merchants."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2861
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_5635bf9a:

    # r "Textiles, yes. I did not learn from them."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2865
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_279196f8:

    # s "Arezki taught you, then, did he?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2869
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_eb02745f:

    # r "He did. North Africa is a land of riders, [Samuel]. The Maghreb is built and carried on horseback."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2873
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_2e61524f:

    # s "I had no idea. Suppose it's that... when I be thinking of knights and all that, they're in England and whatnot."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2877
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_a3661dbc:

    # r "Numidian warriors nearly brought Rome low. Horses like these saw the gates of the city. The world might've been very different, indeed."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2879
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_5e73f38b:

    # s "Huh. Rome, even? The empire, like?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2881
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_1473f32e:

    # r "They were so terrified that, at their eventual victory, they salted the earth. It did not take. The Maghreb still rides."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2883
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_c862611d:

    # "You keep that thought close as the day wears on, focusing on the journey ahead of you."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2889
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_7aa3501e:

    # p "From Arezki?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2893
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_69bd0437:

    # r "Yes. Obviously, he could not consort with someone who was not comfortable on horseback."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2895
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_ed630747:

    # p "He taught you well, then."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2899
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_cd4d8088:

    # r "And gave me cause to use that teaching. But it's in our blood, too."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2901
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_5f815775:

    # p "What do you mean?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2903
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_b3c89b97:

    # r "Hannibal's Numidian allies nearly took Rome itself. The Maghreb cradles two thousand years of the best cavalry in the world."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2905
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_da81c9ca:

    # "It occurs to you that Arezki was not, himself, a cavalryman."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2907
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_115b9094:

    # "That giving Rajeeyah 'cause' to make use of such skill has curious implications."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2909
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_6013a50d:

    # "But they're implications for another time. For now, you focus on the journey ahead, as the day stretches onward."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2927
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_6c27aa04:

    # "Waning sunlight spills golden over the rocks and valleys. The sound of the surf lulls you."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2929
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_41890b6c:

    # "You have become so distracted that you assume the regular shape on the horizon is just another boulder."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2931
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_7072b2c9:

    # "Gradually, though, it becomes sharper, assuming the sharp stone walls of a fortress. You aren't certain it's occupied, but smoke rises from what must be a nearby town."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2933
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_f2fd0006:

    # "The land is becoming more green, too. Not enough for fields, but the scrub and wispy trees become thicker, and the eventual sight of a broad river comes as no great surprise."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2946
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_aa00c733:

    # r "This is the town of Aguz. With luck, we'll find a stable here. Wait for me."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2951
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_f5ad4f02:

    # "She did not specify whether or not you were to wait in the saddle. The chance to stretch your legs is too tempting."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2956
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_6fe128b3:

    # "Even more so for Sam, who winces when [his] feet touch the ground."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2958
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_7cdd58e7:

    # s "Can't believe folk do that every day."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2960
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_8386f9b9:

    # p "Farmers can't believe you climb rigging every day."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2964
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_668f5395:

    # s "Fair enough. You think a stable means for us, too, [name]?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2966
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_68bf8a6a:

    # p "I hope so."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2968
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_c7d0b591:

    # s "Wouldn't mind not having to try the bedrolls, I tell you. Scandalous, like."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2970
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_a37c88c2:

    # p "Raj will figure something out."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2974
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_bd4a67dc:

    # s "Aye, she will. Smarter than us lot, to be sure."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2976
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_a73895bb:

    # p "I hope we're able to find... find {i}something{/i} in Safi, at least."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2980
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_074d8140:

    # s "You think her lover's there?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2982
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_193a86ae:

    # p "No.{w} Do you?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2984
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_765599b1:

    # s "Not likely, I don't reckon."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:2988
translate Chinese day16_journey_start_e6cb6bc1:

    # s "Important thing is: she deserves not to be thinking on him no more. Whatever it takes to help her do that, I will."
    s ""

