translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_7d074ac3:

    # r "Want to be alone. It is difficult, on the ship."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3425
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_81995764:

    # p "Try standing watch at night."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3427
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_8b7a35d8:

    # r "You are alone with your {i}thoughts{/i} there. But..."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3429
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_de61bbb7:

    # "She holds up her paw, bidding you be quiet. Indeed, the cheetah is holding her breath."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3431
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_938ce3e8:

    # "You strain your ears to catch whatever Rajeeyah might've heard. There is nothing. Nothing, and nothing, and nothing."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3433
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_44804767:

    # "Faint whispers, like quiet voices behind the closed wooden door of an ancient church."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3435
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_5afa0be6:

    # "Even as you try to pick out the language, the pitch rises; a few seconds later, the wind ruffles your fur."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3437
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_e88a54a1:

    # "And the voices fade as the wind does."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3439
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_b05b5d98:

    # r "It gives one an appreciation for solitude."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3441
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_1f7c8732:

    # p "But you don't want to be alone?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3443
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_7f5e6830:

    # r "Still, I take the opportunity when it's given. Wouldn't you? Like [Samuel] and [his] baths."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3447
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_139bffb0:

    # "Perhaps, even in a normal tone of conversation, the sound wouldn't carry back to where the maned wolf is sleeping."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3449
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_c2bdeb3c:

    # "You, like Rajeeyah, are keeping your voice low."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3451
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_ea39bbd6:

    # p "I haven't spent much time alone. We had a small house... the farm was busy, and so was the town."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3453
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_3c4291ee:

    # r "Safi did not offer a quiet upbringing. I learned it out here."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3455
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_0efddb72:

    # "You recall a story she recounted a few days ago—slipping off with her lover Arezki, on a night that must surely have been like this one."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3457
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_7cb618ea:

    # "Does that mean she learned to be alone from him?"
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3459
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_789a902b:

    # "Rajeeyah, no doubt, does not need you to point out the irony."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3461
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_4fcb2351:

    # p "May I ask you a question?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3463
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_54657bde:

    # r "Only if it's a good one."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3465
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_e1e4f6c7:

    # "Is she teasing you? The darkness—and being too close for you to see the movements of the cheetah's tail—makes it harder than usual to read her mood."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3467
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9f46c760:

    # p "If you're homesick for the desert... when did it become your home?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3469
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_3540da3d:

    # "The shadow of her head tilts, questioningly."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3471
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_e79d4a52:

    # p "There are things I miss about my village. I mean...{w} well, I don't miss them now, that is. But if I thought I was never going back, I'd miss them."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3473
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_8aaf65ec:

    # p "A neighbor boy, a bit older, he showed me a spring one day. Late summer, after the harvest..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3475
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_2e3e4f6f:

    # "After {i}most{/i} of the harvest, but it was the last year you were young enough to escape some of the work."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3477
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_576c518d:

    # "The spring was on the way—for a generous definition—to the next town over. The day had been warm, and the hike a substantial one for a kitten's legs."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3479
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_37cc7a99:

    # "The water, bubbling from mossy rocks like magic, tasted so sweet that the other boy had laughed gaily at your surprise."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3481
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_4f199de7:

    # p "The land's not good for much, so I think the spring will be there forever. It's always felt the same."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3483
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9651539e:

    # p "But when I say I'd miss it, I think... I think I mean I'd miss what it meant to me as a boy."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3485
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_ee25fc47:

    # r "Hm."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3487
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_6c2f6d3c:

    # p "Am I making sense?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3491
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_0cb7395e:

    # "She leans back, putting her arms behind her for support, and searches the stars for a long time."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3493
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9f6a8335:

    # r "When I was old enough to realize nothing {i}would{/i} be home until I found my own way to it."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3495
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_8b02f925:

    # p "What would've happened if you'd stayed?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3497
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_19b65817:

    # r "I should be some sad creature, then, her highest aim to be worthy a dowry... 'Worth!'"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3499
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_a54b659b:

    # "Her snorted laugh, when she repeats the word, is nakedly bitter."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3501
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_6eda8b23:

    # p "I don't quite understand."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3503
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_806b783b:

    # r "Only that it is strange, for my worth to be what my family would pay to the family of my husband. Where do I fit into that?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3505
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_fd5f55ba:

    # p "Oh."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3507
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_5aa70b44:

    # r "Not that they would call it a dowry—nothing so honest. No matter the name, the desert is where I first knew that I could not bear it."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3509
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_96cf46b1:

    # p "I wondered if..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3511
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_d8764a43:

    # r "If it made me pine for my lover, and the stars beneath which we met? The first time I felt his arms around me?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3513
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_a93cefe2:

    # "Even without looking, you can {i}hear{/i} the cheetah's wry, knowing smile."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3515
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_fdbd5be7:

    # p "I would've phrased it less... ridiculously."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3517
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9655763c:

    # r "You are a 'romantic' like that, then. No, it's not Arezki's doing."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3519
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_d75712a0:

    # r "I tell you what, [name]. Lie back, why don't you?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3521
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3523
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_0287df3a:

    # r "Lie down on your back. The rock is comfortable enough."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3529
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_b7fb5b8b:

    # "You have your doubts about that, but do as the cheetah suggests."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3531
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_2e79d745:

    # r "Without the masts, and the rigging..."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3533
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_83080e36:

    # "She trails off, and you allow yourself to take in the sky above you. The stars are as clear and cold as they were on the {i}Conway{/i}."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3535
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_da78fda5:

    # "And yet..."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3537
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_b3651c8b:

    # "And yet, she's right. It's easy to find an angle where there is nothing between you and those stars. Nothing to ground yourself."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3539
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_0143f2ef:

    # "The veil between your world and the heavens fades to an insubstantial shimmer."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3541
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_5e3bb053:

    # r "Above us is {i}al-Nasr al-Waqi'a{/i}, the Falling Eagle."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3543
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_15456169:

    # "You try to echo the name, but the sounds the cheetah used in {i}Waqi'a{/i} seem to be impossible for your own throat."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3545
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_6654fe01:

    # r "That is why you pronounce it {i}Vega{/i}, I suppose."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3547
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_cd52f2b1:

    # p "Vega, then. It's beautiful..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3549
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9e997809:

    # r "By itself.{w} By itself, {i}al-Nasr{/i} is beautiful. By themselves, the stars are worth my time."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3551
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_b618a220:

    # r "For the stars, I need no man. Do you see?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3553
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_bd889df4:

    # p "Yes. Of course."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3560
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_c3c4aa1d:

    # "Looking at them, you have the sense that precious little is holding you to the warm earth at your back."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3562
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_846a4942:

    # "Shove off with the slightest pressure, and you would fall, ever-upwards, until Mogador was its own glittering pinprick of distant light."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3564
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_f10f990f:

    # "And what, then? Would you find your way back?"
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3566
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_55712ed0:

    # p "Is it that..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3568
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_f1ab55ca:

    # "As you pause to collect your thoughts, you reflexively feel for a hold on the rock beneath you, as if you might indeed lose your grip."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3570
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_2b3089c4:

    # p "Is it that you are homesick for a world big enough to get lost in?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3572
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_75d3dc94:

    # r "That is an interesting way of putting it."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3574
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_a9c582b0:

    # r "Only a world big enough for unwary travelers to get lost in could be a world big enough to contain the path you're looking for."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3576
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_96b72319:

    # p "The town I grew up in was too small for me to get lost."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3578
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_79ac85ae:

    # "Then again: that is, surely, precisely what she meant."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3580
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_82a52807:

    # r "And now?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3582
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_eada2597:

    # p "I'm learning."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3584
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_522ca73c:

    # r "Learning what?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3586
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_8d421a16:

    # p "Not to be lost."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3590
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_5152c80c:

    # "You sit up—despite what Rajeeyah said, the rock was decidedly uncomfortable—and search the night sky."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3592
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_f2608f14:

    # p "That's the north star, right?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3594
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_bec3b4af:

    # r "Yes."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3596
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_c64e8a0a:

    # p "What do you call it?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3598
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_e1742a4c:

    # r "In Morocco?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3600
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_ac50adf1:

    # p "In your language, yes. Like the Falling Eagle."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3602
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_f8523118:

    # r "The Kid."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3604
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_efdba155:

    # p "Does it... mean the same thing, somehow? A north star?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3606
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_176fe23b:

    # r "It does not. The caliphate's astronomers cataloged {i}al-Judayy{/i} before it {i}was{/i} the north star."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3608
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_fc2c2a0b:

    # r "When it danced around the pole like a young goat at play."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3610
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_7d904243:

    # p "Ah! That sort of kid."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3612
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_2aa14e35:

    # r "Yes. Now, it seems, it has grown, and settled down."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3614
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9f48b304:

    # "Somewhere, amongst the stars, there is a metaphor to be made of that. While you're trying to think of it, though, Rajeeyah continues."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3616
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_1f445e9d:

    # r "We are better at astronomy than medicine, I think. A long history of navigators."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3618
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_90171b2b:

    # p "You don't mean to become lost, either."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3620
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_f63cd1d7:

    # r "When I have a choice in the matter, which is not always."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3622
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_e5095153:

    # "She draws her breath in, as if to sigh. Instead, she gives your knee a pat."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3624
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_5f371ae7:

    # r "You are an... appreciably adventurous sort, [name]. How was the journey? I didn't ask."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3628
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_52449fca:

    # p "I feel fine. Better than Sam, I think."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3630
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_c86db90e:

    # "Even being unable to able to see her expression, the way Rajeeyah shakes her head gives away the kind of rueful feeling that says {i}oh, what am I going to do with that dog?{/i}"
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3632
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_0a07cecc:

    # r "I should've known. But [he] would've talked [his] way into coming, I suppose."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3634
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_4fd85356:

    # p "You two get along well."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3636
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_ea51157e:

    # r "You sound surprised."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3638
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_32b65cf9:

    # p "Oh, no... I mean, you do seem like an odd duo, I guess. Sam is always so full of spirit and you are...{w} My apologies, that sounded less awkward in my head."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3640
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_4b18fd90:

    # "She chuckles."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3642
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_e83a77fa:

    # r "Are we? Maybe we are, but that's what makes [him] such a treat to be around."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3644
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_e2eb842c:

    # r "Whenever it's needed [he] just manages to drag me out of a rut, somehow."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3648
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_5276cf42:

    # r "Besides, it is necessary to occasionally escape you men and talk with another woman."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3652
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_ea561534:

    # p "To see if you're still sane?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3654
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9156a2e6:

    # r "Something to that effect."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3656
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_4655c6e2:

    # r "And over the years we just spent a lot of time together. Taught her to read with Arthur, helped her keep her disguise up where I could, and spent plenty of evenings together."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3658
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_be246b11:

    # "Another gentle laugh escapes her lips."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3660
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_bdbd5257_1:

    # p "Hm?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3662
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_c770a45a:

    # r "Nothing. Just remembered when I first had the pleasure to treat [him]. As a small token of appreciation [he] gave me some sand afterwards."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3664
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_0eb48651:

    # p "Sand? Like... Why?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3666
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9efd38bc:

    # r "I should clarify that it was bottled, mind you. [He] didn't just drop loose sand across my lap and leave."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3668
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_f0541092:

    # r "Told me that last time around, [he] had to get stitched up by Arthur and those scars are visible to this day."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3670
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_b416f790:

    # r "They probably would be no matter who played surgeon, but can you imagine how adorable it was to have someone hand you a little bottle of sand, simply because you dealt with their food poisoning?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3672
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9d01e2ec:

    # p "Still, why sand?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3674
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_451ddd4c:

    # r "It's a thing [he] does.{w} Well, not as a gift typically, but collecting it. From the places we visit."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3676
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_dc900401:

    # "You hadn't even thought of something like that. Taking a little token with you from every place you visit?"
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3678
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_aac58a7f:

    # "Maybe you should."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3680
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_4a0afe7b:

    # r "And, naturally, I was immediately recruited to label them all."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3682
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_34d517fe:

    # p "Do you still have yours?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3684
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_5fe3ff2f:

    # r "Of course. Can hardly throw it away, can I?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3686
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_3a9f3dc5:

    # r "Eventually this all will end. I might leave, or [he] might. Either way, I might not see [him] again."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3688
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_ae5fb55f:

    # r "This way I have something to remind me of our times together."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3690
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_53a14bfe:

    # "You look up at the stars again."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3692
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_2eeb96bf:

    # p "I'm glad [he]'s here."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3694
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_32c8f574:

    # r "As am I. The journey isn't terrible, either. The road is well-maintained."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3696
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9f88cf7e:

    # p "And we weren't traveling very fast."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3700
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_f80118e7:

    # p "I feel fine. We weren't traveling very fast."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3702
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_2eaf35a6:

    # r "I'm glad to hear."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3704
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_131e5619:

    # r "No sense in wearing out the horses. We can still reach Safi by tomorrow."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3706
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_06d9110b:

    # p "And then..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3708
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_cfa0731a:

    # r "Then, I shall see how lost I am."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3710
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_742a307f:

    # p "If you are, we can find a way back."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3712
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_cef7b90b:

    # r "You with your north star, is that it?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3714
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_ffe3e255:

    # p "Exactly."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3716
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_f6be618f:

    # r "I needed to hear that, I think."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3729
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_9b52f4a3:

    # "She gets to her feet, and helps you up."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3731
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_ba46c270:

    # r "We should sleep. Or rest, at least."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3733
translate Chinese day16_rajeeyah_night_00892cc8:

    # "The bedroll hasn't become any more comfortable since you left it. But, focusing on your breathing, you shut your eyes and will yourself to forget the feeling of consciousness."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3773
translate Chinese day17_morning_b68e9576:

    # "Morning brings a crisp chill, strikingly at odds with the day to come. Rajeeyah is awake, too."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3775
translate Chinese day17_morning_9fd035ae:

    # "Recently, from the way she's stretching."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3785
translate Chinese day17_morning_aa7a8ce4:

    # "Sam had the right idea, with huddling together for warmth. You should've taken the opportunity."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3789
translate Chinese day17_morning_ac544209:

    # "[He] stirs, grumbling, when you sit up."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3791
translate Chinese day17_morning_70960872:

    # s "What I wouldn't give for a hammock and too many sailors around as company."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3798
translate Chinese day17_morning_1e785294:

    # r "We'll have sun in a few minutes, and warmth with it."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3805
translate Chinese day17_morning_63564dc5:

    # s "That's good. These old bones freeze easy."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3813
translate Chinese day17_morning_cc74f944:

    # "Sam gets to [his] paws, and offers a paw to pull you up, which you take gladly."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3815
translate Chinese day17_morning_eb38a15a:

    # r "We should water the horses and eat breakfast. Safi isn't too far."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3817
translate Chinese day17_morning_2f3fe2d5:

    # p "This evening?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3819
translate Chinese day17_morning_790e2353:

    # r "Afternoon. And there will be an inn. With walls, and a bed."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3821
translate Chinese day17_morning_1539a1de:

    # "At that moment, the prospect is so tantalizing you practically drool at the thought."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3823
translate Chinese day17_morning_c9d8a7ad:

    # "More than you would for breakfast, certainly. At the river's edge, you offer to refill the water skins."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3825
translate Chinese day17_morning_e8360e48:

    # "It tastes clean enough, though the {i}Conway{/i} has probably lowered your standards."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3827
translate Chinese day17_morning_7870c95f:

    # "By the time you've finished, Rajeeyah has parceled out some dates to go along with the rations you were given."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3831
translate Chinese day17_morning_e7af21f3:

    # r "This will do nicely, I think."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3835
translate Chinese day17_morning_92842417:

    # s "Aye. I feared it might be hardtack. Bless him, Bandile be kinder than that to us poor lot."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3837
translate Chinese day17_morning_fc7b897a:

    # p "Bread?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3841
translate Chinese day17_morning_c99418ec:

    # r "Close to it."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3845
translate Chinese day17_morning_997e251f:

    # "Even slightly stale, and having spent a day in your saddlebags, the biscuit is perfectly edible."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3847
translate Chinese day17_morning_e9b30af7:

    # "That is to say: it doesn't intend to break off any of your teeth."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3849
translate Chinese day17_morning_25a017e2:

    # "The three of you eat in silence that only lasts half a minute before Sam speaks up."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3851
translate Chinese day17_morning_1ab8a5d6:

    # s "I woke up a bit, and the both of you was gone off somewhere, I think. Wasn't it?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3853
translate Chinese day17_morning_6b8fa606:

    # r "Yes. I didn't want to rouse you, [Samuel]."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3855
translate Chinese day17_morning_c6717dc0:

    # s "How was he?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3859
translate Chinese day17_morning_acdd13e0:

    # r "Perfectly marvelous, if you must know."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3861
translate Chinese day17_morning_74160c2b:

    # "Rajeeyah, glaring at [him] across her biscuit, takes a delicate bite to let the response sit before continuing."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3865
translate Chinese day17_morning_8678340a:

    # r "Not that it is your business to do so..."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3867
translate Chinese day17_morning_c9406bcd:

    # s "Ah—but we be friends. That's why I'm here with you, Raj."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3869
translate Chinese day17_morning_c26b0866:

    # r "As a friend, [Samuel], I'm telling you to eat your breakfast."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3871
translate Chinese day17_morning_7ab3fa9d:

    # s "Yes, yes. [name]: how was she?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3873
translate Chinese day17_morning_346d3bc4:

    # p "I think she would kill me if I said, Sam."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3877
translate Chinese day17_morning_f63f4300:

    # "The maned wolf furrows [his] brow, searching first your face, and then the cheetah's."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3881
translate Chinese day17_morning_8f899268:

    # s "Well, now I don't know what to believe. I had it in my head you two was just off talking. Now—"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3885
translate Chinese day17_morning_13da0146:

    # s "Hey! I see that grin, Raj, and don't you think I can't."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3889
translate Chinese day17_morning_43ff687d:

    # r "{i}Breakfast{/i}. We have another long ride today."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3893
translate Chinese day17_morning_d7e9636a:

    # s "Well, aye. But is that {i}another{/i} for you, or a third?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3895
translate Chinese day17_morning_99a525ff:

    # "Rajeeyah pauses, then lunges in Sam's direction, as if making ready to pounce [him]."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3900
translate Chinese day17_morning_18f201e1:

    # "Sam draws back before giggling. The teasing is good-natured—helped, no doubt, by the promised warmth of the sun."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3906
translate Chinese day17_morning_78bc4357:

    # "Rajeeyah finishes eating first—and quickly, evidently eager to be back in the saddle."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3908
translate Chinese day17_morning_5d7fdc8d:

    # "Even if you're not looking forward to the ride itself, the prospect of a town with proper food and lodging is sufficient motivation."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3914
translate Chinese day17_morning_96a98c2d:

    # "At the river's edge, she pauses, and bids the two of you wait for her."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3916
translate Chinese day17_morning_786912b8:

    # "You watch the cheetah pick her way across the water, working with her horse to find bits of solid ground."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3918
translate Chinese day17_morning_23742050:

    # "Broad as the stream is, the current is gentle, and it never rises even to the stirrups. From the far side, she calls back to you."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3920
translate Chinese day17_morning_4bb3c3b6:

    # r "Can you follow me, [name]?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3922
translate Chinese day17_morning_0dcde6ad:

    # p "I think so, yes."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3924
translate Chinese day17_morning_13970fa0:

    # r "Good. Take it slowly. [Samuel], you should dismount."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3926
translate Chinese day17_morning_722ed750:

    # s "What?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3928
translate Chinese day17_morning_51061672:

    # p "Guide your horse on foot, she means."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3930
translate Chinese day17_morning_c5d2724f:

    # s "She don't trust me? You don't think I can manage it, Raj?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3932
translate Chinese day17_morning_dcd1a81c:

    # r "I don't want you getting thrown and breaking your neck."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3934
translate Chinese day17_morning_b56a7a9a:

    # p "You did lie to us about being able to ride a horse..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3938
translate Chinese day17_morning_fa9ddf7c:

    # "Muttering, Sam works [himself] down from the saddle."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3940
translate Chinese day17_morning_cb4e55cf:

    # s "You country boys..."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3942
translate Chinese day17_morning_8c9f2ac9:

    # "For all that, though, the crossing is easy. None of you falter."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3944
translate Chinese day17_morning_87fd97ab:

    # "As the maned wolf is clearly aware, running [his] paws down [his] dripping legs to wring the water out."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3946
translate Chinese day17_morning_dd64619d:

    # s "I'll remember this, I will..."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3948
translate Chinese day17_morning_3cca0cbc:

    # r "I know. Let's be off, now."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3953
translate Chinese day17_morning_6a5bfa78:

    # r "Feeling rested, [name]?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3955
translate Chinese day17_morning_be9151cf:

    # p "I'm not sure I'd go that far..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3960
translate Chinese day17_morning_69c7dd1e:

    # "She gives you a sympathetic smile, and then a paw for you to pull yourself to your feet."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3962
translate Chinese day17_morning_94131865:

    # r "The sun will be up soon, and the day will warm quickly."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3964
translate Chinese day17_morning_481df389:

    # "You wonder what 'soon' means, although the sky is bright, already, and the horizon glows with the answer."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3968
translate Chinese day17_morning_08f98f81:

    # r "We should water the horses and have some breakfast. Safi isn't too far, though."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3970
translate Chinese day17_morning_d3cbd7ba:

    # p "By the evening?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3972
translate Chinese day17_morning_3c70d986:

    # r "The afternoon, probably. We made it further than I expected."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3976
translate Chinese day17_morning_e9e8b429:

    # "'Breakfast,' while the horses drink their fill and snuffle around in the bag of feed their owner provided, is a pleasant surprise."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3978
translate Chinese day17_morning_fd9117d5:

    # "You'd thought it was hardtack, but Bandile has been kinder to you. The bread is stale, but soft enough not to threaten any of your teeth."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3980
translate Chinese day17_morning_367fe4c3:

    # "Rajeeyah produces a handful of dates, and tips a few into your outstretched paw."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3984
translate Chinese day17_morning_4acbbd31:

    # p "{i}Shukrun{/i}."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3988
translate Chinese day17_morning_75dd16d9:

    # r "Oh? {i}Afwan{/i}."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3990
translate Chinese day17_morning_42b42aeb:

    # "She grins, and gives you another date."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3992
translate Chinese day17_morning_76400cf4:

    # r "Safi is a city, at least. There will be an inn. With a bed."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3994
translate Chinese day17_morning_8cec4858:

    # p "Your family still lives there, though, don't they?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:3998
translate Chinese day17_morning_12241d5d:

    # r "I do not know that I am welcome. I most certainly would not be welcome with a foreign man."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4000
translate Chinese day17_morning_c10c4ffa:

    # "She seems to be in good spirits—not even the prospect of being 'unwelcome' has dampened them."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4002
translate Chinese day17_morning_d2c90319:

    # p "I don't have money for an inn. They've not paid me."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4004
translate Chinese day17_morning_f72d2eec:

    # r "I know. We'll manage."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4008
translate Chinese day17_morning_013e0f7c:

    # "Rajeeyah puts away the rest of her breakfast, and starts off for the horses. You savor your last date, and do the same."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4010
translate Chinese day17_morning_9950c2af:

    # p "If you're certain..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4014
translate Chinese day17_morning_ff6448e2:

    # r "What else would you do? Sleep on the streets?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4018
translate Chinese day17_morning_2ea96d7f:

    # "She pats her horse's neck affectionately before pulling herself into the saddle and waiting for you to do the same."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4022
translate Chinese day17_morning_a6b4e2f7:

    # r "I think the ship's fund will cover some of this."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4024
translate Chinese day17_morning_22b6d2c8:

    # p "It will?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4028
translate Chinese day17_morning_a2312806:

    # r "Yes. I... a moment, [name]. Follow carefully, will you?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4034
translate Chinese day17_morning_4560e067:

    # "The cheetah's attention has turned to the river."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4041
translate Chinese day17_morning_8d5bbc7b:

    # "She nudges her horse forward. Broad as the stream is, it doesn't seem terribly deep."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4043
translate Chinese day17_morning_7c0e393e:

    # "You gather that she's picking out areas of solid ground, instead—half-buried reefs and flat boulders with sufficient purchase for her horse to trust."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4045
translate Chinese day17_morning_12095acb:

    # "Your own mount 'follows' more consciously than you do, though the water never rises even to the level of the stirrups."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4047
translate Chinese day17_morning_40851086:

    # "Once you've crossed, she guides you up the slope and back to the worn track of a proper road."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4049
translate Chinese day17_morning_0d68d695:

    # r "I shall make something of the journey. Arezki or no. This, I have decided."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4051
translate Chinese day17_morning_76fe4609:

    # p "What would you make of it?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4053
translate Chinese day17_morning_5a256747:

    # r "Items for the {i}Conway{/i}... things I didn't acquire in Mogador, or didn't know where to find."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4055
translate Chinese day17_morning_1852b7ff:

    # p "You'll be able to find them in Safi?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4057
translate Chinese day17_morning_b06fe2e3:

    # r "There will still be merchants I know; apothecarists. Even some who would take news from abroad in partial trade."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4059
translate Chinese day17_morning_b88ca7ce:

    # p "Oh. That makes sense. Arthur will understand, then?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4061
translate Chinese day17_morning_7758aa85:

    # r "The quartermaster will, too. Yes."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4063
translate Chinese day17_morning_3c164015:

    # "{i}Yes{/i}, she repeats, more decisively, as though talking herself into the conclusion."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4065
translate Chinese day17_morning_0c734732:

    # r "This will be a valuable trip. Thank you for accompanying me, [name]."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4069
translate Chinese day17_morning_a5e57b47:

    # r "{cps=5000}This will be a valuable trip. Thank you for accompanying me, [name].{/cps}" nointeract
    r "" nointeract

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4073
translate Chinese day17_morning_e815a9f1:

    # p "You're welcome."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4077
translate Chinese day17_morning_6246b4af:

    # p "Do you still intend to search for Arezki?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4079
translate Chinese day17_morning_5cfff095:

    # "Her mood, as you might have expected, clouds briefly. But it seems, to you, a curious decision to make the trip without such resolution."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4081
translate Chinese day17_morning_ae6e535f:

    # r "If fate wills it."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4083
translate Chinese day17_morning_f0053c61:

    # p "Whether it does or not, I..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4085
translate Chinese day17_morning_3c46b32b:

    # r "Yes?"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4087
translate Chinese day17_morning_45a3a49c:

    # p "I am here to help in whatever way I can."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4089
translate Chinese day17_morning_17f6b56f:

    # r "Then you, too, should trust in fate."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4091
translate Chinese day17_morning_c4648c1a:

    # p "And if it proves to be uneventful... is that, itself, the hand of fate?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4093
translate Chinese day17_morning_8493899e:

    # r "I should think so."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4111
translate Chinese day17_morning_ab69c375:

    # "The day's travel is easier. Aguz, Rajeeyah explains, is an important link to another inland town, Aghmat."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4113
translate Chinese day17_morning_abb8ea1e:

    # "The road north to Safi is well-maintained, and increasingly well-used. You meet a steady stream of travelers, heading south."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4125
translate Chinese day17_morning_837107b0:

    # "And, to Sam's delight, overtake a caravan of camels."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4127
translate Chinese day17_morning_7db52b28:

    # "[His] appearance has drawn the attention of more than one passerby. [His] glee at the sight of the strange creatures does nothing to help how conspicuous the maned wolf is."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4131
translate Chinese day17_morning_72fea97e:

    # s "You know, they be eyeing me something fierce..."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4135
translate Chinese day17_morning_312d40af:

    # r "You were pointing at their camels and gasping."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4139
translate Chinese day17_morning_ddbf6f8c:

    # s "Well, it was me first time seeing one. Funny-looking things, them."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4141
translate Chinese day17_morning_85673cf7:

    # p "Are they friendly like horses?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4147
translate Chinese day17_morning_0b3fdad7:

    # r "Or friendlier, even, if you believe their owners."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4151
translate Chinese day17_morning_98930010:

    # "And overtake others, including a large caravan whose horses seem strange and gangly. Camels, you realize—you've never seen one, only heard about them in stories."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:4153
translate Chinese day17_morning_86a01126:

    # "Rajeeyah pays no particular mind, but you can't help being captivated by the odd creatures, with their long lashes and curving necks."
