# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5348
translate Chinese day17_safi_3eb9d01f:

    # az "She kept trying to boss the servants around, as if nothing was the matter, but of course—"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5358
translate Chinese day17_safi_6cd61ccf:

    # r "And the way she pointed at you! 'You! You have done this to me.' Arezki protested, of course."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5368
translate Chinese day17_safi_939112a3:

    # az "I did! My honor was at stake!"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5378
translate Chinese day17_safi_67ecb8c7:

    # r "The merchant asked if it was true. And he stood and proclaimed: 'I am no demon, my lord. If your wife has been turned into a grape, look elsewhere.'"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5388
translate Chinese day17_safi_9eb23ace:

    # az "And I am not! Am I?"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5398
translate Chinese day17_safi_07f91171:

    # r "{i}Sayyidi. Lastu jinni, sayiddi.{/i}"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5400
translate Chinese day17_safi_09f8aeca:

    # "She tries to affect what must, you suppose, have been Arezki's severe and serious air at the time."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5406
translate Chinese day17_safi_5aa0f90c:

    # "She breaks out laughing, though, and gives up, dabbing at her eyes with the handkerchief."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5416
translate Chinese day17_safi_982a219c:

    # az "We were not invited to finish tea."
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5426
translate Chinese day17_safi_64158599:

    # r "Or to be paid."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5436
translate Chinese day17_safi_626515af:

    # az "Or to so much as retrieve our cloth... I have never run so quickly. And she outpaced me, this one. She is fast."
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5438
translate Chinese day17_safi_91ff1386:

    # p "I believe it. She runs on the ship, even, with what little space there is."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5442
translate Chinese day17_safi_fb625a85:

    # az "On the ship! What are you running from on a ship, Rajeeyah?"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5452
translate Chinese day17_safi_32f836c9:

    # r "For exercise. And it helps me think."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5462
translate Chinese day17_safi_cccc07b8:

    # az "Hm. She is not allowed into the cargo hold, is she?"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5464
translate Chinese day17_safi_2ab41c48:

    # p "I don't think anyone would stop her..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5466
translate Chinese day17_safi_0c59577b:

    # az "Oh, yes, I see."
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5476
translate Chinese day17_safi_247556e8:

    # r "Arezki!"
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5482
translate Chinese day17_safi_d4f6f8b1:

    # s "She has her own space, though, where she keeps things. We don't be snooping around there. Who knows what she's keeping."
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5491
translate Chinese day17_safi_82cae511:

    # az "Oh, I {i}see{/i}."
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5500
translate Chinese day17_safi_8878c491:

    # r "You are not helping, [Samuel]."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5502
translate Chinese day17_safi_d3c3955e:

    # s "Sorry!"
    s ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5512
translate Chinese day17_safi_15742339:

    # az "Ah, you can trust her. I know this."
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5514
translate Chinese day17_safi_4a128840:

    # r "The dye was not our doing, certainly."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5516
translate Chinese day17_safi_35d35b79:

    # p "Was it permanent?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5518
