    # az "You mean: did she remain a grape forever? No."
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5528
translate Chinese day17_safi_134062e2:

    # r "When he pressed her that evening, wine came out. You can be sure of that."
    r ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5532
translate Chinese day17_safi_9ea24fe3:

    # "You can't be certain, after the discussion, how cautious Rajeeyah is still being. The frostiness of her demeanor has ebbed. When Arezki's paw nudges hers, she does not pull away."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5542
translate Chinese day17_safi_2f903428:

    # "But, when he slides closer, her eyes narrow. And when, after much less eventful tea, Arezki goes to arrange bedding for you, Rajeeyah tells him that she will stay wherever you and Sam do."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5546
translate Chinese day17_safi_7c58a19f:

    # "But, when he slides closer, her eyes narrow. And when, after much less eventful tea, Arezki goes to arrange bedding for you, Rajeeyah tells him that she will sleep in the same room—not his."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5548
translate Chinese day17_safi_a5dc6cf7:

    # "He does not protest this. Dense, folded tapestries serve as mattresses. You ignore the embroidery and focus on the softness at your back. It's as comfortable as your cot on the ship, at least. All the same, you sleep fitfully—if at all."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5562
translate Chinese day17_safi_0e05057a:

    # "You're in a strange place, and in a stranger's quarters. It seems best to be wary."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5566
translate Chinese day17_safi_8cd61f25:

    # "Between the excitement of being in a new place, and the drama of the day..."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5577
translate Chinese day17_safi_03b2c473:

    # "You leave your companions, and follow the currents of air to a stairway at the house's rear, and then up onto the building's roof."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5584
translate Chinese day17_safi_8ad41188:

    # "It isn't long before you hear footsteps, and turn to see a cheetah's silhouette."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5586
translate Chinese day17_safi_ec37c3e0:

    # az "You will not sleep?"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5588
translate Chinese day17_safi_300701d2_1:

    # p "I..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5592
translate Chinese day17_safi_53bc3456:

    # az "Nervous?"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5596
translate Chinese day17_safi_34493f06:

    # "You try to think of a way to explain your nerves without arousing any further suspicion."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5600
translate Chinese day17_safi_95c3b072:

    # "You're not sure he'll really understand, but you try your best."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5602
translate Chinese day17_safi_8f81cff6:

    # p "Three weeks ago, I had never ventured further than a few leagues from my home."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5604
