    # p "The same. And it was Mogador."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5636
translate Chinese day17_safi_58eab627:

    # az "For me, it was Tunis. Much of my life was spent from oasis to oasis. You know what a tree is, I suppose?"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5638
translate Chinese day17_safi_3b88c420_3:

    # p "Yes."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5640
translate Chinese day17_safi_26032d61:

    # az "Well, imagine when I saw 'New England' for the first time, from the bow of the {i}Caesar Rodney{/i}."
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5642
translate Chinese day17_safi_06b5d4dc:

    # p "It is forested?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5646
translate Chinese day17_safi_88344fda:

    # az "Immensely! When I saw how green it was, I thought..."
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5650
translate Chinese day17_safi_26f6dd85:

    # "The cheetah smiles, as if sharing a mildly embarrassing secret with you."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5654
translate Chinese day17_safi_047d3294:

    # "Despite your skepticism of the man, it's difficult to deny how charming he can be. Is it an act? Or were you being too quick to judge?"
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5656
translate Chinese day17_safi_e5674149:

    # az "I thought, perhaps, that I was seeing mirages, as sailors do. All their phantom ships, and phantom towers, and phantom islands..."
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5658
translate Chinese day17_safi_99e612f7:

    # az "After so long at sea, perhaps, my vision was failing me. But no. And did you know that they change color?"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5660
translate Chinese day17_safi_0465fe93:

    # p "Yes? Some of them do."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5664
translate Chinese day17_safi_bec90962:

    # az "I had no idea. It is often, [name], that I cannot sleep. For... what if something new found me then, and my eyes were closed?"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5668
translate Chinese day17_safi_2817eae4:

    # "Arezki gives a vigorous shake of his head. And he regards you as though he has found, at last, a kindred spirit."
    ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5672
