    # az "Does she not think of what she has left behind?"
    az ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5714
translate Chinese day17_safi_b8a42dcf:

    # p "With you, you mean? And the life you lead? She thinks of it, but not kindly."
    p ""

# game/script morocco rajeeyah.rpy:5718
translate Chinese day17_safi_fa05e071:

    # az "I did fear that. But she has too much of the desert in her, still. She'll never be content at sea."
